{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50981","headline":"仙客 · 李昉","name":"仙客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胎化仙禽性本殊，何人携尔到京都。\n因加美号爲仙客，称向闲庭伴野夫。\n警露秋声云多远，翘沙晴影月中孤。\n青田万里终归去，暂处鸡羣莫叹吁。\n（见《宋诗纪事》卷二。\n）（见《瀛奎律髓》卷二七。\n）（〖1〗《青箱杂记》〖宋吴处厚撰〗：「昉所畜五禽，名五客，仙客鹤，雪客鹭，闲客白鹇，陇客南客孔雀，西客鹦鹉，有诗云。\n」〖今本《青箱杂记》无此条。\n〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}